{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000020", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000022"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "You reject it because, you know, you still think you have time.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000020"}, {"quote": "Two, maybe three months into selling, still no serious buyer. And the pressure starts building.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000021"}, {"quote": "printed and exhausted. He just wants it to be over with.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000022"}], "text": "A property seller initially prices their property at market value but fails to secure a buyer after several months. Under financial pressure, their frustration grows, leading them to lower the price significantly."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Illustration of property seller's experience", "topic": "Dubai real estate strategy"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:cases:321ee4ea3d3dc622", "metadata_hash": "e0492e74824e430ceb5e15ff532827cb37b654f0e6a470a7bf9a3cdb27f556b7", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Illustration of property seller's experience", "topic": "Dubai real estate strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000023"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Real distress deals like this can be gone within two or three hours.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000023"}], "text": "Highly competitive real estate environments like Dubai's can lead to real distress deals disappearing within hours."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Urgency in securing distress deals", "topic": "Dubai real estate strategy"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:cases:1653080475ff0ec9", "metadata_hash": "e0492e74824e430ceb5e15ff532827cb37b654f0e6a470a7bf9a3cdb27f556b7", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Urgency in securing distress deals", "topic": "Dubai real estate strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate-strategy"}
